ing one of your daily forecasts. ", "short_description": "Get ready for a game-changing virtual experience where AccuWeather, the largest, most accurate source of forecasts and weather warnings in the world, takes you to new heights!\n\nWith AccuWeather- Weather for Life, you can view engaging 360 video content, current weather conditions, a daily and hourly forecast, and AccuWeather MinuteCast\u00ae, the leading minute-by-minute precipitation forecast, hyper-localized to your exact location.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.accuweather.com/en/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.accuweather.com/en/legal", "publisher_name": "AccuWeather Intl., Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.accuweather.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["CASUAL", "UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "364858238365395"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1255863847830374"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1255863847830374"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1489669200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1255863847830374"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1284350034994458", "version": "1.0.32"}, "id": "694307157414685", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBi